Aim:
To develop an EasyToll website for online toll payment and transaction management.

Algorithm:

Create the webpage structure using HTML.
Apply CSS to design the website layout.
Use JavaScript to display toll payment details.
Allow users to enter vehicle information.
Display toll charges based on the selected route.
Provide an option to enter payment details.
Calculate and display the total toll amount.
Display the payment confirmation after submission.

Result:
The EasyToll website was developed successfully to display toll charges and simulate online toll payments.
